\"main-content\"><div class=\"blog-page-wrap\"><section class=\"blog-hero\" style=\"max-width:900px\"><nav class=\"blog-eyebrow reveal\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"blog-eyebrow-link\">Home</a><span class=\"blog-crumb-sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&middot;</span><a href=\"/blog\" class=\"blog-eyebrow-link\">Blog</a><span class=\"blog-crumb-sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&middot;</span><span class=\"blog-crumb-current\" aria-current=\"page\">Studio</span></nav><h1 class=\"reveal delay-1\">Letters, Cassette and ConstBooth Radio: the ConstBooth <span class=\"accent\">Studio</span></h1><p class=\"blog-hero-sub reveal delay-2\">Guides to writing a digital letter, recording a digital cassette, and hearing anonymous voice messages on ConstBooth Radio.</p></section><nav class=\"blog-filter\" aria-label=\"Browse by category\"><ul class=\"blog-filter-list\"><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog\">All articles</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/guides\">Guides</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/ideas\">Ideas</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/occasions\">Occasions</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/long-distance\">Long Distance</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/photography\">Photography</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/culture\">Culture</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/studio\" aria-current=\"page\">Studio</a></li></ul></nav><h2 class=\"blog-count\">4 articles in Studio</h2>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"blog-index-container\"><div class=\"blog-grid blog-grid-4\"><a href=\"/blog/creative-ways-to-make-digital-memories-online\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"studio\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/creative-ways-to-make-digital-memories-online-480.avif?v=9fee20c1 480w, /assets/blog/creative-ways-to-make-digital-memories-online-640.avif?v=1e4a87a7 640w, /assets/blog/creative-ways-to-make-digital-memories-online-960.avif?v=c08f7680 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/creative-ways-to-make-digital-memories-online-480.webp?v=5ee8131c 480w, /assets/blog/creative-ways-to-make-digital-memories-online-640.webp?v=4f655304 640w, /assets/blog/creative-ways-to-make-digital-memories-online-960.webp?v=90a17720 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/creative-ways-to-make-digital-memories-online-960.webp?v=90a17720\" alt=\"A cassette tape, a handwritten letter in an envelope, and a vintage radio, side by side\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>3 Creative Ways to Make Digital Memories Online: Letters, Cassettes & ConstBooth Radio</h3><p>Three ways to make a digital memory that actually gets revisited: a folded letter, a voice recording, and anonymous voice messages.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/digital-love-letter-online\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"studio\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/digital-love-letter-online-480.avif?v=5285a1a2 480w, /assets/blog/digital-love-letter-online-640.avif?v=5165e13b 640w, /assets/blog/digital-love-letter-online-960.avif?v=e2961c1d 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/digital-love-letter-online-480.webp?v=b18a601d 480w, /assets/blog/digital-love-letter-online-640.webp?v=c5846d63 640w, /assets/blog/digital-love-letter-online-960.webp?v=a70436c1 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/digital-love-letter-online-960.webp?v=a70436c1\" alt=\"A handwritten digital letter with a photo strip, beside a kraft paper envelope\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>How to Make a Digital Love Letter Online With Photos & Memories</h3><p>How to write, add photos to, fold and send a digital love letter online - free, no account needed.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/digital-cassette-voice-message\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"studio\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/digital-cassette-voice-message-480.avif?v=4ae26075 480w, /assets/blog/digital-cassette-voice-message-640.avif?v=4f48308d 640w, /assets/blog/digital-cassette-voice-message-960.avif?v=b3c336dc 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/digital-cassette-voice-message-480.webp?v=20d88434 480w, /assets/blog/digital-cassette-voice-message-640.webp?v=bad0bde4 640w, /assets/blog/digital-cassette-voice-message-960.webp?v=37a1978f 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/digital-cassette-voice-message-960.webp?v=37a1978f\" alt=\"Two cassette tapes labelled Awesome Mix, one pink and one yellow\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>How to Make a Digital Cassette With Your Voice, Photos & Memories</h3><p>How to record your voice onto a digital cassette, with a photo and label of your own.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/anonymous-voice-messages-tiny-radio\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"studio\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/anonymous-voice-messages-tiny-radio-480.avif?v=0f37f256 480w, /assets/blog/anonymous-voice-messages-tiny-radio-640.avif?v=18813c93 640w, /assets/blog/anonymous-voice-messages-tiny-radio-960.avif?v=fa2a3eb3 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/anonymous-voice-messages-tiny-radio-480.webp?v=c31abc05 480w, /assets/blog/anonymous-voice-messages-tiny-radio-640.webp?v=fa6c4527 640w, /assets/blog/anonymous-voice-messages-tiny-radio-960.webp?v=6bf915da 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/anonymous-voice-messages-tiny-radio-960.webp?v=6bf915da\" alt=\"A green retro tabletop radio with a tuning dial and FM frequency scale\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>ConstBooth Radio: Hear Anonymous Voice Messages From Strangers Online</h3><p>Tune in to hear anonymous voice messages from strangers, or leave one of your own - not live, safety-checked.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"blog-hub-more\" aria-labelledby=\"more-topics\"><h2 id=\"more-topics\" class=\"blog-hub-more-title\">Browse by topic</h2><ul class=\"blog-hub-more-list\"><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/photo-strips\">Photo Strips</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/couples\">Couples</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/friends\">Friends</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/long-distance\">Long Distance</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/party-ideas\">Party Ideas</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/holidays\">Holidays</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/beginners\">Beginner Guides</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/aesthetics\">Aesthetics</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/printing\">Printing &amp